<view class="page"><view class="vi-brand-row"><image class="vi-corporate-logo" src="/assets/brand/betech-logo-orange.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>Beline Home</text></view><view class="eyebrow">APARTMENT SERVICE</view><view class="row"><view><view class="h1">{{isStaff?'服务工单':'贴心服务，一直在'}}</view><view class="muted">报修进度，随时可查</view></view><view class="mark"><image class="vi-service-icon" src="/assets/icons/tool.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view></view><button class="primary wide" bindtap="repair">＋ 提交报修</button><view class="section">{{isStaff?'商户全部工单':'我的报修'}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{tickets}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text class="strong">{{item.title}}</text><text class="pill {{item.status==='pending'?'orange':''}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="muted" style="margin:20rpx 0">{{item.description}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.roomNumber}} 室 · {{item.type}} · {{item.date}}</view><view class="sub">处理人：{{item.assignee||'待分配'}}</view><view class="steps"><text>提交</text><text>→</text><text>受理</text><text>→</text><text>处理</text><text>→</text><text>确认</text></view><button wx:if="{{(isStaff||item.status==='resolved')&&item.status!=='closed'}}" class="wide" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="advance">{{item.status==='pending'?'受理并派单':item.status==='processing'?'标记处理完成':'确认完成并归档'}}</button></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!tickets.length}}">暂无报修，愿你的每一天都顺心</view><view class="notice">此工程与浏览器演示各自保存本地数据；小程序内不同角色共享同一份演示数据。</view></view>
